WEBVTT

00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:13.570
A crimson illusion dominates the high tower,

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:20.830
as the chimera sings and flies.

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:28.590
The cold blade slays all emotions,

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:40.170
as providence awaits on the path ahead.

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:47.050
Chapter 11

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:47.050
Endless Struggle

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:09.060
Painful, isn't it?

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:17.090
It's an advanced strain of a neurotoxin extracted from the <i>phoneutria</i> genus that lives in the Amazon!

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:19.280
It won't allow you to recover quickly.

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.650
Are you familiar with the words of the ancient literary master, Tolstoy?

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:26.740
"Within an infinitely evolving civilization,

00:01:26.740 --> 00:01:29.410
as long as one's death remains meaningless,

00:01:29.410 --> 00:01:31.830
then one's life is meaningless as well."

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:38.130
I will transcend this idea by becoming someone who can manipulate both life and death!

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:40.050
In order to do that, Kuro,

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:44.760
I require your head!

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:55.100
Looks like your resilience is weakening.

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:57.810
I guess that body of yours is nearly at its limit.

00:01:59.270 --> 00:01:59.820
Kuro.

00:02:02.230 --> 00:02:05.490
Don't move or he'll notice...

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:09.910
He'll soon be within your grasp.

00:02:10.410 --> 00:02:12.040
He's to the right, behind you.

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:37.400
Kuro, right above you.

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:43.570
In front of you.

00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:47.410
Directly behind you.

00:03:09.890 --> 00:03:10.760
Kuro?

00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:16.770
Kuro? Kuro...?

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:19.350
Are you okay?

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:24.820
Kuro, can you hear me?

00:03:25.820 --> 00:03:26.860
I...

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:30.610
can't see him from here.

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:34.160
Be careful.

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:45.800
You're to blame?!

00:05:11.760 --> 00:05:14.890
You're still able to scream like that?!

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:18.730
You're just a human that's not even fit to be a puppet.

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:21.310
I'm going to replace his head with Kuro's...

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:24.730
to give birth to a superior form of life!

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:27.230
I shall impinge on God's domain!

00:05:27.230 --> 00:05:33.490
This is your punishment for interfering with my dream as it was reaching fruition!

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:46.880
Become a sacrifice to the creation of a superior form of life that transcends death!

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:13.690
Ironically, I was aiming for her neck...

00:06:14.690 --> 00:06:16.070
But instead,

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:20.830
it was my own neck that was punctured.

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:08.790
A past where my past doesn't exist.

00:07:10.390 --> 00:07:12.360
What manner of beast am I?

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:51.130
I am nothing.

00:07:52.090 --> 00:07:57.420
Even now... every day... that feeling clings to me.

00:07:58.510 --> 00:08:01.050
It's time for this mystery to be exposed.

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:14.900
No matter what else happens...

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:21.620
I must meet this woman.

00:08:22.990 --> 00:08:25.370
I have finally...

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:29.540
reached the end of all things.

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:43.130
And yet... what could this feeling be?

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:50.680
Something feels wrong.

00:08:51.270 --> 00:08:52.730
This is not enough.

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:56.060
Can I express this feeling more eloquently?

00:08:56.060 --> 00:09:01.030
Could it be... there are still things I haven't been told?

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:04.700
Could it be that I am still being deceived?

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:08.580
By who? By that woman?

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:12.290
Or perhaps, by myself?

00:09:17.380 --> 00:09:18.710
Or perhaps...

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:21.210
by fate?

00:11:58.290 --> 00:12:02.420
What does the phrase "please forgive me" mean?

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:07.420
I have done much in your name.

00:12:08.130 --> 00:12:09.550
Infiltrating Haniwa...

00:12:11.630 --> 00:12:14.510
On your behest, I waited for Kuro to appear...

00:12:16.140 --> 00:12:19.930
I don't know the reason behind these actions, but you should know...

00:12:20.850 --> 00:12:24.060
All this time, I have devoted my life to you.

00:12:25.110 --> 00:12:29.400
So that I can see your joyous face, Lady Kuromitsu!

00:12:51.140 --> 00:12:53.260
Just the two of us left.

00:14:03.960 --> 00:14:07.170
You intend to use my body, don't you?

00:14:07.920 --> 00:14:09.420
What's happened, Kuon?

00:14:09.420 --> 00:14:13.550
For that man... Yes, for him....

00:14:15.760 --> 00:14:18.850
You created me so he could use me, didn't you?

00:14:20.970 --> 00:14:26.480
Your true desire was Kuro, wasn't it?

00:14:27.230 --> 00:14:31.530
Am I not worthy enough to be your
companion on your journey, is that it?

00:14:32.780 --> 00:14:34.820
Am I no good?

00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:40.830
You don't...

00:14:44.080 --> 00:14:46.250
love me?

00:14:56.170 --> 00:15:04.680
You don't love me at all?

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:25.580
Kuon...?

00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:13.300
Kuon.

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:15.710
I'll kill you!

00:16:24.720 --> 00:16:30.980
If only you weren't here!

00:16:34.900 --> 00:16:39.690
Die, you bastard!

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:42.130
Kuro, tell me this...

00:17:43.760 --> 00:17:48.140
Was the Kuromitsu I saw an illusion?

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:55.190
She had three small moles on her ribs...

00:17:56.650 --> 00:17:59.900
Did I imagine seeing them?

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:11.460
What's with that face?

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:17.500
So even your face can make that expression, Kuro?!

00:19:30.660 --> 00:19:34.790
Countless people have perished,

00:19:35.410 --> 00:19:43.710
and the tides have heaved, turned and twisted for years.

00:19:44.920 --> 00:19:50.800
Your aim was to head for the black tomb of Adachigahara,

00:19:50.800 --> 00:20:04.520
and now, you have reached it unknowingly.

00:20:13.160 --> 00:20:28.170
Next Chapter

00:20:18.890 --> 00:20:28.170
The Black
Tomb
